§ `ss 46, 47, 48(2)`

#ASSERT `ss 46, 47 -- the last day to notify` (`the date` 1 8 2026) EQUALS `the date` 8 8 2026
#ASSERT `ss 46, 47 -- the last day to notify` (`the date` 28 12 2026) EQUALS `the date` 4 1 2027
#ASSERT `ss 46, 47 -- notified in time` (`the date` 1 8 2026) TRUE (`the date` 1 8 2026) EQUALS `in time`
